   "subject": "gamma(.., ..)^2 -> generalized_gamma(?, ?, ?)",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hello,<div><br></div><div>I have shape and rate parameters of a gamma distribution that seem to be related as some form of rate=shape^2</div><div><br></div><div>Now I want to observe if rate followes a generalized_gamma distribution. Howeve my dummy attempts for developing such function failed in test</div><div><br></div><div><p style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(36,41,46);font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif,&quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;;font-size:14px\">I found the generalised gamma function in BUGS </p><p style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(36,41,46);font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif,&quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;;font-size:14px\"><br></p><p style=\"text-align:left;clear:both\"><a href=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-m_7Yqs1ujBs/WRZV-xzxgiI/AAAAAAAAFDU/Vlkv-3sAW1MVbn6c_dFksnAkZsfyqnWegCLcB/s1600/Capture.PNG\" style=\"margin-left:1em;margin-right:1em\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-m_7Yqs1ujBs/WRZV-xzxgiI/AAAAAAAAFDU/Vlkv-3sAW1MVbn6c_dFksnAkZsfyqnWegCLcB/s1600/Capture.PNG&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792457535606000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0xuSuVyJtfmkNeaXRmk953\"><img src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-m_7Yqs1ujBs/WRZV-xzxgiI/AAAAAAAAFDU/Vlkv-3sAW1MVbn6c_dFksnAkZsfyqnWegCLcB/s400/Capture.PNG\" border=\"0\" width=\"400\" height=\"255\"></a></p><p style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(36,41,46);font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif,&quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;;font-size:14px\"><br></p><p style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(36,41,46);font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif,&quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;;font-size:14px\">these are the attempts</p><p style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(36,41,46);font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif,&quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;;font-size:14px\">#1</p><p style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><font color=\"#24292e\" face=\"-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Segoe UI, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, Apple Color Emoji, Segoe UI Emoji, Segoe UI Symbol\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">set.seed(1)   # for reproducible example</span></font></p><p style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><font color=\"#24292e\" face=\"-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Segoe UI, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, Apple Color Emoji, Segoe UI Emoji, Segoe UI Symbol\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">s = 50</span></font></p><p style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><font color=\"#24292e\" face=\"-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Segoe UI, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, Apple Color Emoji, Segoe UI Emoji, Segoe UI Symbol\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">r = 3</span></font></p><p style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><font color=\"#24292e\" face=\"-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Segoe UI, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, Apple Color Emoji, Segoe UI Emoji, Segoe UI Symbol\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">x &lt;- rgamma(10000,shape=s,rate=r)</span></font></p><p style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><font color=\"#24292e\" face=\"-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Segoe UI, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, Apple Color Emoji, Segoe UI Emoji, Segoe UI Symbol\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">stan(</span></font></p><p style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><font color=\"#24292e\" face=\"-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Segoe UI, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, Apple Color Emoji, Segoe UI Emoji, Segoe UI Symbol\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>model_code=&quot;</span></font></p><p style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><font color=\"#24292e\" face=\"-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Segoe UI, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, Apple Color Emoji, Segoe UI Emoji, Segoe UI Symbol\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>functions{</span></font></p><p style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><font color=\"#24292e\" face=\"-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Segoe UI, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, Apple Color Emoji, Segoe UI Emoji, Segoe UI Symbol\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t\t</span>real ggamma_lpdf(real x, real a, real b, real c) {</span></font></p><p style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;color:rgb(36,41,46);font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif,&quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;;white-space:pre\">\t\t</span><span style=\"font-size:14px;color:rgb(36,41,46);font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif,&quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;\">return( (c*a * (log (c) + log(b)) ) + ((c*a - 1) * log (x) ) + (-(b*x)^c ) - log( tgamma(a) ));</span><br></p><p style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><font color=\"#24292e\" face=\"-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Segoe UI, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, Apple Color Emoji, Segoe UI Emoji, Segoe UI Symbol\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t\t</span>}</span></font></p><p style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><font color=\"#24292e\" face=\"-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Segoe UI, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, Apple Color Emoji, Segoe UI Emoji, Segoe UI Symbol\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>}</span></font></p><p style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><font color=\"#24292e\" face=\"-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Segoe UI, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, Apple Color Emoji, Segoe UI Emoji, Segoe UI Symbol\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>data {</span></font></p><p style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><font color=\"#24292e\" face=\"-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Segoe UI, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, Apple Color Emoji, Segoe UI Emoji, Segoe UI Symbol\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>int&lt;lower=1&gt; G;</span></font></p><p style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><font color=\"#24292e\" face=\"-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Segoe UI, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, Apple Color Emoji, Segoe UI Emoji, Segoe UI Symbol\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>vector[G] y; </span></font></p><p style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><font color=\"#24292e\" face=\"-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Segoe UI, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, Apple Color Emoji, Segoe UI Emoji, Segoe UI Symbol\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>}</span></font></p><p style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><font color=\"#24292e\" face=\"-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Segoe UI, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, Apple Color Emoji, Segoe UI Emoji, Segoe UI Symbol\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>parameters { real&lt;lower=0&gt; h[3]; }</span></font></p><p style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><font color=\"#24292e\" face=\"-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Segoe UI, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, Apple Color Emoji, Segoe UI Emoji, Segoe UI Symbol\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>model { for(g in 1:G) y[g] ~ ggamma(h[1], h[2], h[3]); }</span></font></p><p style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><font color=\"#24292e\" face=\"-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Segoe UI, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, Apple Color Emoji, Segoe UI Emoji, Segoe UI Symbol\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>&quot;, </span></font></p><p style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><font color=\"#24292e\" face=\"-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Segoe UI, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, Apple Color Emoji, Segoe UI Emoji, Segoe UI Symbol\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>data = list(G=length(x), y=x)</span></font></p><p style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><font color=\"#24292e\" face=\"-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Segoe UI, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, Apple Color Emoji, Segoe UI Emoji, Segoe UI Symbol\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">)</span></font></p><p style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><font color=\"#24292e\" face=\"-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Segoe UI, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, Apple Color Emoji, Segoe UI Emoji, Segoe UI Symbol\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><br></span></font></p><p style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><font color=\"#24292e\" face=\"-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Segoe UI, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, Apple Color Emoji, Segoe UI Emoji, Segoe UI Symbol\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><br></span></font></p><p style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><font color=\"#24292e\" face=\"-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Segoe UI, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, Apple Color Emoji, Segoe UI Emoji, Segoe UI Symbol\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">#2</span></font></p><p style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><font color=\"#24292e\" face=\"-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Segoe UI, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, Apple Color Emoji, Segoe UI Emoji, Segoe UI Symbol\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">set.seed(1)   # for reproducible example</span></font></p><p style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><font color=\"#24292e\" face=\"-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Segoe UI, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, Apple Color Emoji, Segoe UI Emoji, Segoe UI Symbol\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">s = 50</span></font></p><p style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><font color=\"#24292e\" face=\"-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Segoe UI, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, Apple Color Emoji, Segoe UI Emoji, Segoe UI Symbol\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">r = 3</span></font></p><p style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"></p><p style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><font color=\"#24292e\" face=\"-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Segoe UI, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, Apple Color Emoji, Segoe UI Emoji, Segoe UI Symbol\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">x &lt;- rgamma(10000,shape=s,rate=r)</span></font></p><p style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><font color=\"#24292e\" face=\"-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Segoe UI, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, Apple Color Emoji, Segoe UI Emoji, Segoe UI Symbol\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">stan(</span></font></p><p style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><font color=\"#24292e\" face=\"-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Segoe UI, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, Apple Color Emoji, Segoe UI Emoji, Segoe UI Symbol\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>model_code=&quot;</span></font></p><p style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><font color=\"#24292e\" face=\"-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Segoe UI, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, Apple Color Emoji, Segoe UI Emoji, Segoe UI Symbol\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>functions{</span></font></p><p style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><font color=\"#24292e\" face=\"-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Segoe UI, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, Apple Color Emoji, Segoe UI Emoji, Segoe UI Symbol\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t\t</span>real ggamma_lpdf(real x, real a, real b, real c) {</span></font></p><p style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><font color=\"#24292e\" face=\"-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Segoe UI, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, Apple Color Emoji, Segoe UI Emoji, Segoe UI Symbol\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t\t</span>return(log(c*b^(c*a) * x^(c*a - 1) * exp(-(b*x)^c) / tgamma(a)));</span></font></p><p style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;color:rgb(36,41,46);font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif,&quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;;white-space:pre\">\t\t</span><span style=\"font-size:14px;color:rgb(36,41,46);font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif,&quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;\">}</span><br></p><p style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><font color=\"#24292e\" face=\"-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Segoe UI, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, Apple Color Emoji, Segoe UI Emoji, Segoe UI Symbol\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>}</span></font></p><p style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><font color=\"#24292e\" face=\"-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Segoe UI, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, Apple Color Emoji, Segoe UI Emoji, Segoe UI Symbol\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>data {</span></font></p><p style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><font color=\"#24292e\" face=\"-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Segoe UI, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, Apple Color Emoji, Segoe UI Emoji, Segoe UI Symbol\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>int&lt;lower=1&gt; G;</span></font></p><p style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><font color=\"#24292e\" face=\"-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Segoe UI, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, Apple Color Emoji, Segoe UI Emoji, Segoe UI Symbol\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>vector[G] y; </span></font></p><p style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><font color=\"#24292e\" face=\"-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Segoe UI, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, Apple Color Emoji, Segoe UI Emoji, Segoe UI Symbol\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>}</span></font></p><p style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><font color=\"#24292e\" face=\"-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Segoe UI, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, Apple Color Emoji, Segoe UI Emoji, Segoe UI Symbol\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>parameters { real&lt;lower=0&gt; h[3]; }</span></font></p><p style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><font color=\"#24292e\" face=\"-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Segoe UI, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, Apple Color Emoji, Segoe UI Emoji, Segoe UI Symbol\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>model { for(g in 1:G) y[g] ~ ggamma(h[1], h[2], h[3]); }</span></font></p><p style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><font color=\"#24292e\" face=\"-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Segoe UI, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, Apple Color Emoji, Segoe UI Emoji, Segoe UI Symbol\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>&quot;, </span></font></p><p style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><font color=\"#24292e\" face=\"-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Segoe UI, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, Apple Color Emoji, Segoe UI Emoji, Segoe UI Symbol\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>data = list(G=length(x), y=x)</span></font></p><p style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><font color=\"#24292e\" face=\"-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Segoe UI, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, Apple Color Emoji, Segoe UI Emoji, Segoe UI Symbol\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">)</span></font></p><p style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><font color=\"#24292e\" face=\"-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Segoe UI, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, Apple Color Emoji, Segoe UI Emoji, Segoe UI Symbol\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><br></span></font></p><p style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><font color=\"#24292e\" face=\"-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Segoe UI, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, Apple Color Emoji, Segoe UI Emoji, Segoe UI Symbol\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Thanks</span></font></p></div></div>"
